Third-party fixture (DEV/TEST ONLY — never distributed)
---------------------------------------------------------

`fixtures/whale-girl/` contains a **local development and test fixture**
copied from the `whale-girl` project, used only to prove
`src/packs/whaleGirlCompat.ts` against a real whale-girl-format pack and to
run this repo's own test suite. It is never imported by `src/` at runtime,
never referenced by `elftia-plugin.json`, and is asserted absent from every
build output by `scripts/verify-no-fixture-bytes.mjs` (task 8.7) — see that
script's gate for the proof, not just this notice, before trusting a build.

